1
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:09,700
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,740
=Episode 3=

3
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:15,740
(I'll Make You Wish You Were Dead)

4
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:18,340
(Chengxi Palace)

5
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,320
Is everything taken care of?

6
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,320
Yes, Your Highness.

7
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,600
I've done everything
just as you instructed.

8
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,320
Now everyone in the palace

9
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,880
believes Lingxi accidentally fell

10
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,720
when she was playing

11
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:31,080
and met with a tragic end.

12
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:34,600
See that it stays that way.

13
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:39,560
Your Highness.

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:40,800
This is...

15
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,640
I reward and punish fairly.

16
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,400
Those who do poorly must be punished.

17
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,200
Those who do well must be rewarded.

18
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,000
As for Princess Jinxuan's title,

19
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:51,840
I'll find a chance
to speak to His Majesty.

20
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:55,840
Thank you, Your Highness.

21
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,760
I owe everything to you, Your Highness.

22
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,360
It's my honor

23
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,760
to be of service to you.

24
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,600
But remember this.

25
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:07,360
If Lingxi's matter comes to light,

26
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,200
you'll take the blame.

27
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:12,680
Otherwise, whether your daughter lives
to see her wedding day

28
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:15,200
will be up to fate.

29
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,400
Of course.

30
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:22,280
I would never implicate you.

31
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,240
Take your reward and leave.

32
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:26,920
Yes, Your Highness.

33
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,200
(Oh, no.)

34
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:43,120
(Where's the pearl on my hairpin?)

35
00:01:45,620 --> 00:01:48,860
(Jinghe Palace)

36
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:50,720
How is it?

37
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,000
Have you found the pearl?

38
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:52,960
Your Highness.

39
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:54,800
I searched every corner

40
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,240
of the imperial garden,

41
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,120
but I still couldn't find it.

42
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,080
Why did I have to wear

43
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,720
that hairpin that day?

44
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,880
That pearl was a gift from His Majesty.

45
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:08,440
It's the only one
in the entire inner palace.

46
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,280
Your Highness, that proves nothing.

47
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,840
If anyone asks,

48
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,240
you can just say

49
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:16,520
you accidentally lost the hairpin.

50
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,000
That wretched Fu Rong!

51
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:32,240
She doesn't know her place.

52
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,080
Her mute daughter

53
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,960
dared to compete with Jinxuan
for a title!

54
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:40,120
Now she's got the title

55
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,840
and the longevity lock.

56
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,800
What a shame she's dead.

57
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:47,680
That's what you get for crossing me!

58
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:50,080
Your Highness!

59
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,040
Your Highness!

60
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,400
Something's wrong!

61
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:55,280
I was just passing
Consort Qi's Zhongning Palace

62
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,760
when I overheard some maids gossiping.

63
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,080
They said Cairen Rong has found evidence

64
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,560
that Princess Lingxi was murdered

65
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:02,120
and is going to the Imperial Study
to report this to His Majesty!

66
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:03,880
Evidence?

67
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,160
What evidence?

68
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,760
It seems to be a pearl.

69
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:09,400
What?

70
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:13,080
That's what I heard from the maids.

71
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:16,080
They said Princess Lingxi
was clutching it when she died.

72
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,200
Your Highness.

73
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,320
Your Highness.

74
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:24,040
That little wretch Lingxi!

75
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:25,920
So that's where
the South Sea pearl went!

76
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,720
She tore it off.

77
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:30,280
It would've been one thing
if you'd simply lost it.

78
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:32,560
But if it was found in Lingxi's hand...

79
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:35,200
Your Highness, this is hard to explain.

80
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,160
This could put you in trouble.

81
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:38,720
No.

82
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:41,760
She must not see His Majesty!

83
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:43,960
Let's go!

84
00:03:58,600 --> 00:03:59,240
Stop.

85
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,800
You dare not bow to me?

86
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,160
Have you no manners?

87
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:04,840
Zhaoyi Shen,

88
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,680
if you keep acting so arrogantly

89
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,640
and throwing your weight around,

90
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,440
your good days

91
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,600
will soon be over.

92
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:23,960
I heard
from the Imperial Household Department

93
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:26,360
that the palace has been chaotic lately.

94
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:29,400
Someone's been stealing
and selling off palace property.

95
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:33,000
What's in this wooden box?

96
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,480
Something that could cost you your life.

97
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,320
Seize her!

98
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:42,800
Yes!

99
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:58,280
You vicious woman! Let me go!

100
00:04:58,440 --> 00:04:59,400
Let you go?

101
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:00,960
I've worked so hard

102
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,480
to bring you under my heel.

103
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,720
Why would I let you go?

104
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,760
I'll tell you this:

105
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:09,880
Even if that box
holds a priceless treasure,

106
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:12,120
I'd rather destroy it

107
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:14,800
than let you give it to His Majesty.

108
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,680
Hold her down!

109
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:25,400
What are you doing?

110
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,600
Let go of me! Let go!

111
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:31,120
I'll destroy whatever's in this box

112
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,160
and cripple your hands.

113
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,560
Then you'll learn

114
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,960
what happens when you cross me!

115
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:39,720
Zhaoyi Shen,
you'd better think this through.

116
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:40,960
If you destroy it,

117
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:41,880
His Majesty will be furious.

118
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:43,600
Can you bear the cost?

119
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,600
You dare threaten me?

120
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,960
What could I possibly not
take responsibility for?

121
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,280
What is this?

122
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:14,920
I'm asking you, what is this?

123
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:31,840
This...

124
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:32,880
This is...

125
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,240
Huguo Temple's

126
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:35,960
Eight-Treasure Glazed Pagoda.

127
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,080
You wretch!

128
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:44,160
Her Majesty the Empress Dowager
has arrived!

129
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,580
(The Empress Dowager)

130
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:52,880
This...

131
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:56,560
This is Her Majesty's
Eight-Treasure Glazed Pagoda!

132
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,000
This...

133
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:58,560
What?

134
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,440
Insolence!

135
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,680
Who did this?

136
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:06,840
Who destroyed my
Eight-Treasure Glazed Pagoda?

137
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,080
The Eight-Treasure Glazed Pagoda

138
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:10,960
is the treasured relic of Huguo Temple.

139
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,960
It protects Her Majesty's
health and well-being

140
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:13,920
(Concubine Jing)
and the nation's fortune.

141
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:16,880
Who dared to do this?

142
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:18,160
Confess at once!

143
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,400
Lingxi!

144
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:27,520
Wait...

145
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,480
Have you seen Princess Lingxi?

146
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,360
No.

147
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:38,160
Greetings, Noble Consort.

148
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:47,840
Attendant Jiang,

149
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:50,160
you've served Her Majesty for years.

150
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,520
How could you stoop to stealing

151
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:52,920
like those other servants?

152
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:53,920
Please spare me, Your Highness.

153
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,480
My mother is gravely ill.

154
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,400
I needed money.

155
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,560
So I... I...

156
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,560
Get up.

157
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,400
Don't let it happen again.

158
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:03,360
Thank you, Cairen Rong.

159
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:14,440
Cairen Rong, I've done wrong.

160
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:16,920
I won't report you
for selling palace property,

161
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:18,760
but you must do me a favor.

162
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:21,240
If you spare me, Your Highness,

163
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:23,040
I'll be forever in your debt.

164
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:26,040
Whatever you need me to do,
just say the word.

165
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:29,360
I heard you're the one
who fetches the Pagoda

166
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:31,800
offered by Her Majesty at Huguo Temple.

167
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:32,720
Yes.

168
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,160
Let me go in your place.

169
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,680
You wretch!

170
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,960
How dare you set me up!

171
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:50,280
Things are completely out of hand
in the inner palace.

172
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,760
How dare you ruin the Empress Dowager's
Eight-Treasure Glazed Pagoda!

173
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,080
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

174
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:56,120
Please calm down!

175
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:58,360
Your Majesties,

176
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,840
I happened to meet Attendant Jiang
on the palace path.

177
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,440
She had a sudden stomachache,

178
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:06,720
so she entrusted me
the Eight-Treasure Glazed Pagoda.

179
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,960
To avoid delay,

180
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,080
I was delivering it

181
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:13,120
to the Empress Dowager's palace.

182
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,520
Then I ran into Zhaoyi Shen.

183
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:15,520
Without asking a thing,

184
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:17,160
she tried to snatch it from me.

185
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:19,120
She smashed it

186
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:21,400
with her own hands.

187
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:23,240
I beg Your Majesty
to judge this matter fairly.

188
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:24,840
Zhaoyi Shen!

189
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:27,120
Are you trying to bring a curse upon me

190
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:29,120
and the fate of our empire?

191
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:30,600
Zhaoyi Shen.

192
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:32,880
Your usual arrogance and insolence
are bad enough.

193
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:35,880
But today, you've committed
an act of outrageous sacrilege.

194
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,160
What punishment do you deserve?

195
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:38,680
Please forgive me.

196
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:39,720
Forgive me, Your Majesty!

197
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:41,800
I had no idea the box contained

198
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:43,440
the Eight-Treasure Glazed Pagoda.

199
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,120
Fu Rong...

200
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,200
That wretched Fu Rong!

201
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:49,480
She snuck around with the box.

202
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:52,480
I thought she was stealing
and selling palace property.

203
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:55,480
Who knew she'd set me up

204
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:57,000
just to frame me?

205
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:59,040
I begged her just now,

206
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,800
and told her not to touch the box.

207
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:03,720
I warned her it would
enrage His Majesty.

208
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,280
Look, Your Majesty.

209
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:09,360
She crushed my hand

210
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,080
just to destroy the box.

211
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:15,400
I beg Your Majesties to give me justice!

212
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:17,560
Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

213
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,400
Innocent?

214
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:22,640
Then tell me, why destroyed the box?

215
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,080
I...

216
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,160
Let me speak for you.

217
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:28,480
You heard that
I had found the South Sea pearl

218
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:31,680
clutched in Lingxi's hand when she died,
and was bringing it to His Majesty.

219
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,120
You panicked,

220
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,240
so you tried to seize it
and destroy the evidence.

221
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,160
I learned of

222
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,640
Lingxi's death yesterday.

223
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:41,320
My heart aches too.

224
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:45,960
You said you found a South Sea pearl
at the scene.

225
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:49,240
And you claim it belongs to Zhaoyi Shen?

226
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:51,760
Yes, I wouldn't dare
make such a false accusation.

227
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,240
When Lingxi died,

228
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:56,320
she was clutching
a South Sea pearl tightly.

229
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:59,880
That pearl could only have come

230
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:02,360
from the hairpin
Your Majesty gifted to her.

231
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:05,360
Lingxi's death was no accident.

232
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:08,520
Zhaoyi Shen murdered her!

233
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,080
It's this vicious woman!

234
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:15,120
She killed my daughter!

235
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:17,640
Cairen Rong, you may not know this,

236
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,800
but my father once gave me

237
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:21,640
two South Sea pearls of different sizes.

238
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:24,000
But as I grew older,

239
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,120
I stopped wearing them.

240
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:27,200
If possessing a South Sea pearl
is enough to prove,

241
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,880
then does that make me a murderer too?

242
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,200
Your Majesty,

243
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,080
we all mourn the tragic death

244
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,480
of Princess Lingxi.

245
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:37,880
But that doesn't give her the right

246
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:39,640
to make false accusations against me.

247
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:42,320
I believe she's lost her senses.

248
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,560
She's gone mad.

249
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:45,480
Cairen Rong.

250
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:48,800
I know you lost your child,

251
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,520
and can't accept it.

252
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:52,480
But one pearl alone

253
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,160
is hardly enough to prove

254
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,160
that Zhaoyi Shen is suspected of murder.

255
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,480
You must stop dwelling on

256
00:11:57,880 --> 00:11:59,800
what happened to Lingxi.

257
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,680
You don't believe me?

258
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:28,080
None of you believe me?

259
00:12:33,080 --> 00:12:34,800
But I do.

260
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:39,080
My daughter must not die in vain!

261
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:42,920
This slap

262
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:45,000
is for Lingxi.

263
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,040
She was just a child!

264
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:49,320
How could you be so cruel?

265
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,320
This slap

266
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,280
is for years of twisting the truth

267
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:54,600
and bullying us!

268
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:56,280
How dare you!

269
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:57,400
You wretch!

270
00:12:57,920 --> 00:12:58,840
How dare you slap me!

271
00:12:58,840 --> 00:12:59,320
You vicious woman!

272
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:00,720
Cairen Rong, let go!

273
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:01,840
You wretch! How dare you!

274
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:03,200
I'll kill you!

275
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,000
How dare you defy your superior!

276
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:05,240
Cairen Rong has gone mad.

277
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,960
Empress Dowager, please stop them.

278
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,360
This is outrageous!

279
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:10,880
Enough! Two royal consorts

280
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:13,880
behaving like common village women!

281
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,000
Have you no shame?

282
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,400
Seize them both!

283
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,480
Yes, Your Majesty!

284
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,640
Zhaoyi Shen,

285
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,160
for your misconduct,

286
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:27,560
destroying the precious imperial gift,

287
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:28,560
and offending the Empress Dowager;

288
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:30,120
Cairen Rong,

289
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:31,960
for failing to safeguard the pagoda,

290
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:33,320
speaking recklessly,

291
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,240
defying your superior,

292
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:36,240
and falsely accusing
and assaulting another consort.

293
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:37,080
Both of you

294
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:39,480
shall be stripped of your titles

295
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:40,600
and sent to the Cold Palace

296
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:41,920
to reflect on your misdeeds.

297
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,880
Your Majesty, please hear me out!

298
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:44,680
What are you waiting for?

299
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:45,760
Take them away!

300
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:50,400
Fu Rong, you wretch!

301
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:51,920
You got me sent to the Cold Palace!

302
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,760
I'll make you wish you were dead!

303
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,480
You wretch!

304
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:59,440
Running around the palace at night.

305
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:00,640
What a disgrace.

306
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:01,960
Forgive me for disturbing you.

307
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,400
Please forgive me.

308
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:11,440
(There's a smell of mugwort on her.)

309
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:21,600
(This scent...)

310
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:23,480
(It's mugwort.)

311
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:25,600
Please forgive me, Cairen Rong.

312
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:26,880
It's fine.

313
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,320
Physician Li, you seem in a hurry.

314
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:30,840
Where are you off to?

315
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:33,200
I was ordered to bring mugwort
to the Cold Palace.

316
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:35,640
(Zhaoyi Shen.)

317
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:38,360
(Today, I took you down with me.)

318
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:39,960
(I had you sent to the Cold Palace)

319
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:43,880
(to find out
what you and Noble Consort Hui)

320
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,600
(are up to in there.)

321
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:47,480
(Justice may be slow,)

322
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:48,720
(but it never fails.)

323
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:51,160
(Once I find the truth,)

324
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:53,400
(everyone who had a hand)

325
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:55,080
(in my daughter's death)

326
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:58,400
(will pay with their lives!)

327
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:05,620
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

328
00:15:05,940 --> 00:15:10,660
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

329
00:15:10,780 --> 00:15:15,460
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

330
00:15:15,660 --> 00:15:20,300
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

331
00:15:20,540 --> 00:15:25,060
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

332
00:15:25,460 --> 00:15:30,100
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

333
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:34,900
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

334
00:15:35,220 --> 00:15:39,860
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

335
00:15:39,980 --> 00:15:44,620
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

336
00:15:44,860 --> 00:15:48,320
♪Let the stars and sea♪

337
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,640
(Changsheng Gate)

338
00:15:49,640 --> 00:15:53,380
♪wait for your return♪
